---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'ban the beep';
const description = 'A campaign to phase out reverse beep alarms in Western Australia.';
const permalink = Astro.site.href;
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} permalink={permalink}>
  <div class="home-container">
    <div class="home-copy">
      <h1>ban the beep</h1>
      <p>
        Broadband alarms are easier to locate than beep alarms.<sup><a href="#fn-1" id="fnref-1">1</a></sup>
      </p>
      <p>
        Our mission is to get laws enacted in Western Australia that mandate phasing out reverse beep alarms.
        The <a href="https://www.wa.gov.au/system/files/2023-01/Noise-fact-sheet-Audible-reversing-alarms.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">state government fact sheet</a> already prefers broadband alarms, and Western Australian law does not require the beep.
      </p>
      <p class="footnote" id="fn-1">
        <a href="#fnref-1" aria-label="Back to reference">1.</a>
        Laroche et al., “Effect of Hearing and Head Protection on the Localization of Tonal and Broadband Reverse Alarms,” <cite>Human Factors</cite> (2022).
        <a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9574903/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9574903/</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-image-container">
      <img
        class="hero-image"
        alt="White pickup truck with a red prohibition mark over its reverse-alarm sound waves, labeled BAN THE BEEP"
        src="/assets/ban-the-beep-ute.jpeg"
        width="760"
        height="1024"
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .home-container {
    align-items: center;
    display: flex;
    flex: 1;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 2em 0;
    min-height: 400px;
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .home-copy {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0 1em;
  }

  .home-copy h1 {
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5em;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .home-copy p {
    font-size: 1.4em;
  }

  .hero-image-container {
    margin: 0 1em;
    max-width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .footnote {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-top: 1.5em;
  }

  .footnote a {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .hero-image {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 550px;
    height: auto;
    margin-bottom: 1em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1200px) {
    p {
      font-size: 1.2em;
    }

    .hero-image {
      max-width: 400px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .home-container {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .home-copy {
      flex: 0;
      padding-bottom: 2em;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
